Needs `perl` (prove). Builds a test image apart from the stock build (own
ImageId, mkosi.output/tests/, own version: tests/mkosi-args.sh), then runs
host tests (t0NNN) and VM tests in it:

```
tests/run                                  # fresh test image, all tests
tests/run --no-build                       # all tests, last test image
tests/vm-run tests/t1000-update-delta.sh   # one VM test
```
